amic config changes, not ones already
=C2=A0 =C2=A0 // declared in server.properties, which are trusted regardles=
s of it. Without this exclusion, a
=C2=A0 =C2=A0 // statically-declared provider plus a restrictive allowlist =
would reject every dynamic config
=C2=A0 =C2=A0 // update below, not just provider-related ones.
=C2=A0 =C2=A0 val propsForClamping =3D new java.util.HashMap[String, String=
](newProps.asJava)
=C2=A0 =C2=A0 propsForClamping.keySet().removeIf(k =3D> k.startsWith("confi=
g.providers"))
=C2=A0 =C2=A0 KafkaConfig.clampDynamicConfigs(propsForClamping)
=C2=A0 =C2=A0 propsForClamping.forEach((k, v) =3D> newProps(k) =3D v){code}
