----------------------------------

             Summary: Design JHM benchmark for "refiner"
                 Key: KAFKA-21026
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-21026
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
          Components: streams
            Reporter: Gavin Wang
