We are inserting a new =E2=80=9Crefiner=E2=80=9D step inside the GC, which =
will insert =E2=80=9Cwarmup tasks=E2=80=9D if configures. The refiner runs =
on every heartbeat, and thus we need to carefully benchmark it.



