Chia-Ping Tsai created KAFKA-21067:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: deflake.yml fails to catch the timeout
                 Key: KAFKA-21067
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-21067
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
            Assignee: Chia-Ping Tsai


{code:java}
echo "exitcode=3D$exitcode" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT

=C2=A0if: steps.junit-test.outputs.gradle-exitcode =3D=3D '124' {code}
It uses the wrong variable name, so it won't generate thread dump even thou=
gh the timeout does happen. The {{GRADLE_TEST_EXIT_CODE}} has the same issu=
e.

BTW, the name "junit-thread-dumps-${\{ env.job-variation }}" references a n=
onexistent variable. It should be fixed as well.



