Hi all,
KIP-1357 has passed the voted and launched in 4.4. During implementation,
we realized if the streams.assignor.name is validate on the broker side, it
will conflict with KIP-919 . In this case, I have updated KIIP-1357 with
change broker side validation to controller validation, which aligns with
all other dynamic configs.

Please take a look and let me know if you have any concerns with this
change.
Best,
Gabriella

