mulatorTest`. The record is explicitly assigned to one partition to isolate=
 the batching decision from sticky partition selection.

The test appends one **uncompressed 1 MiB value** with `batch.size=3D16384`=
, `linger.ms=3D1000`, and an 8 MiB buffer pool. It checks that the batch al=
ready exceeds the target, then asserts that its leader is ready immediately=
. There is no second append or clock advance.

