Here is the observation at my end:=C2=A0
1. We must try to decouple the producer from the share consumer to make it =
work for distributed stream engine like flink, spark streaming, etc2. Txn C=
ommit marker will apply commit to all the participants so share consumer ne=
ed not to ack separately for CTP usecase.
TL;DR of the google doc:=C2=A0https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sWMZ1c3j_=
rwg1jQByZ4rW-66GGoswkRI3DnSUiJPJ94/edit?usp=3Dsharing
