=C2=A01. ShareConsumer polls source records.


=C2=A0=C2=A02. Application decides one final outcome per record:

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0ACCEPT or REJECT.


=C2=A0=C2=A03. ShareConsumer.acknowledge(record, decision) stores decisions=
 locally.


=C2=A0=C2=A04. ShareConsumer creates:

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0ShareAcknowledgements

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0-> source topic/partition + offse=
t-range decisions


=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0ShareGroupMetadata

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0-> group ID + member ID + member =
epoch


=C2=A0=C2=A05. Producer already has an open transaction and calls:


=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0sendShareAcknowledgementsToTransaction(

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0ShareAcknowledgements=
,

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0ShareGroupMetadata

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0)


=C2=A0=C2=A06. Producer TransactionManager adds its own identity:

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0transactional ID + producer ID + producer epo=
ch.


=C2=A0=C2=A07. Producer sends this RPC to each affected source-partition le=
ader:


=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0TxnShareAcknowledge(

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0group/member metadata=
,

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0producer identity,

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0source topic-partitio=
n acknowledgement batches

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0)


=C2=A0=C2=A0Broker staging flow


=C2=A0=C2=A08. Source-partition leader validates:

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0- member ID and member epoch;

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0- member owns the source offsets;

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0- offsets are ACQUIRED;

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0- acknowledgement types are valid.


=C2=A0=C2=A09. It maps each source share partition to its durable state par=
tition:


=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0orders-2 -> __share_group_state-7

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0orders-5 -> __share_group_state-3


=C2=A0=C2=A010. It registers those internal state partitions with the trans=
action:


=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0AddPartitionsToTxn(

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0transactional ID,

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0producer ID / epoch,

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0__share_group_state-7=
,

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0__share_group_state-3

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0)


=C2=A0=C2=A011. It writes each source offset range as TX_PENDING in durable

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0__share_group_state, including producer=
 ID/epoch and ACCEPT/REJECT.


=C2=A0=C2=A0How affected share-state leaders learn about commit


=C2=A0=C2=A012. Producer calls EndTxn(COMMIT) on its transaction coordinato=
r.


=C2=A0=C2=A013. Transaction coordinator reads its durable participant list:


=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0output-orders-0

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0__share_group_state-7

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0__share_group_state-3


=C2=A0=C2=A014. Transaction marker sender resolves the current leader for e=
very

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0participant partition and sends this RP=
C:


=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0WriteTxnMarkers(

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0producer ID,

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0producer epoch,

