ch,

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0COMMIT,

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0participant par=
titions

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0)


=C2=A0=C2=A015. The leaders of __share_group_state-7 and __share_group_stat=
e-3

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0receive their marker request.


