lls:


=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0ShareCoordinatorService.completeTransac=
tion(...)


=C2=A0=C2=A017. The matching ShareCoordinatorShard finds TX_PENDING batches=
 for

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0that producer ID/epoch and finalizes th=
em:


