             Summary: Don't allocate key and value if all we care about is =
the timestamp
                 Key: KAFKA-21081
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-21081
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
