Hi all,

I opened my first two pull requests a week ago and would like to check that I am
following the right process.

- KAFKA-21043: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/23393
- KAFKA-14102: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/23394

Both are small client fixes for running Kafka in a JVM where each deployment
gets its own class loader.

Neither has the ci-approved label yet, so the build has not run on either. Is
there something I should be doing to move them along, or is waiting the right
thing here? Both are rebased on current trunk and the clients suite passes
locally.

Thanks,
Seokmo Yoo

