Whenever we switched to the new website, we broke the links to log compacti=
on. In topic configs, there are several links that point to [https://kafka.=
apache.org/43/configuration/topic-configs/#compaction]

This is a link that just redirects to the topic-config page or when clicked=
 in text, does nothing.


The new location of information about log compaction is [https://kafka.apac=
he.org/43/design/design/#log-compaction-details]=C2=A0



