Hi, Andrew,

Thanks for the reply. A few more comments.

JR4. "The configuration keys are defined in
org.apache.kafka.clients.CommonClientConfigs"
Could you explicitly list the clients (producer, consumer, AdminClient,
etc.) that define the two new configs?

JR5. Should AK frameworks such as kstream and connect set
client.framework.name and client.framework.version in their clients
automatically?

JR6. "Broker-added resources labels for client metrics"
Are the new labels added in DefaultClientTelemetryContext.RequestContext?
Since ClientTelemetryExporter.exportMetrics() only takes
ClientTelemetryContext, does the implementor need to cast it
to DefaultClientTelemetryContext to retrieve the new labels?

Jun

