Hi all,

Can someone please review / merge these PRs?

GitHub PR's links:

   - https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/23169 KAFKA-20943
   Develocity-related Gradle plugin versions are updated
   - https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/23450 KAFKA-21086 GrGit
   dependency is dropped in favor of Eclipse JGit
   - https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/23167 KAFKA-19762 Gradle feature
   for reproducible archives is turned *ON*
   - https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/23426 KAFKA-21126 version updates
   for build and project dependencies; gradle-versions-plugin reference has
   been moved

Regards,
Dejan
https://github.com/dejan2609

