I know we are a couple of days past code freeze but I'd like to include
this bug fix https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20416  into the
4.3.2 release.
I have a PR https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20416 ready to go
now and should be ready to cherry-pick soon.

Let me know if you agree about including this.

-Bill

