Subject: [DISCUSS] KIP-1342: Deprecate Authorizer#aclCount
To: dev@kafka.apache.org
Content-Type: multipart/alternative; boundary="000000000000195933065bc55ae7"
From: Ming-Yen Chung <mingyen066@gmail.com>
Reply-To: <dev@kafka.apache.org>

--000000000000195933065bc55ae7
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"

Hi all,

I would like to start a discussion on KIP-1342: Deprecate
Authorizer#aclCount <https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/x/i5QmGQ>

Authorizer#aclCount() was added for a broker-side metric that was never
implemented. StandardAuthorizer already publishes acls-total-count through
PluginMetrics, so this KIP deprecates the method in 4.5 and removes it in
5.0.


Best,
Ming-Yen

--000000000000195933065bc55ae7--

