> h2. Problem:
> We discovered a strange behaviour on our production environment. We use a=
 KTable to look up data from a topic we write to.
> =C2=A0
> {code:java}
> builder.table(topicName, Consumed.with(keySerde, valueSerde), Materialize=
d.as(storeName)) {code}
