oes need attention. But as an internal design improvement, it doesn't need a =
KIP. We can definitely use the KIP document as a way to discuss the best appr=
oach, but you will not need to get this voted because it does not make extern=
al changes. I expect they're already aware, but I will ping some of the commi=
tters with experience in this area to make sure they take a proper look.

Thanks,
Andrew

