Chia-Ping Tsai created KAFKA-21149:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: Speed up JoinGracePeriodDurabilityIntegrationTest
                 Key: KAFKA-21149
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-21149
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
            Assignee: Chia-Ping Tsai


It can leverage the LEAVE_GROUP to speed up the bounce in {{{}shouldRecover=
BufferAfterShutdown{}}}, since the restart with the same application id wai=
ts for the previous member's session timeout otherwise.
{code:java}
=C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0 // restart the driver
=C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0 driver.close(CloseOptions.groupMe=
mbershipOperation(CloseOptions.GroupMembershipOperation.LEAVE_GROUP));
=C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0 assertEquals(KafkaStreams.State.N=
OT_RUNNING, driver.state()); {code}



