Chia-Ping Tsai resolved KAFKA-21116.
------------------------------------
    Fix Version/s: 4.5.0
       Resolution: Fixed

> Validate configuration value size using UTF-8 bytes
> ---------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-21116
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-21116
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Bug
>            Reporter: Doyeon Kim
>            Assignee: Doyeon Kim
>            Priority: Minor
>             Fix For: 4.5.0
>
>
> ConfigurationControlManager validates ConfigRecord values using String.length(), while ConfigRecord serialization limits values to Short.MAX_VALUE UTF-8 bytes.
> As a result, multibyte values can pass validation and later fail during serialization with a RuntimeException instead of INVALID_CONFIG.



