Hi,
I'd like to begin the vote on KIP-1368 which introduces client
framework name and version into the Kafka protocol so that clients
running in frameworks such as Kafka Streams and Spring can be
identified for problem determination and metrics purposes.

KIP: https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/spaces/KAFKA/pages/440304679/KIP-1368+Client+framework+name+and+version

Discussion thread:
https://lists.apache.org/thread/7fjz97f99hm0nhjoj03wd557wwqwjs80

Thanks,
Andrew

