   Adds LibreDB Studio to the Powered By page: the logo goes in `static/images/powered-by/` and the entry at the end of `data/testimonials.json`.
   
   LibreDB Studio is an MIT-licensed, self-hosted database IDE. Since 0.17.0 it connects to Apache Kafka and lets you browse topics, partitions, consumer groups with their lag, brokers and configs, and read messages by partition, offset or timestamp. It is read-only: it never produces, commits offsets or joins a consumer group.
   
