Chia-Ping Tsai resolved KAFKA-21173.
------------------------------------
    Resolution: Fixed

> Consider adding `--no-parallel` to release.py to avoid multiple staging repositories being built
> ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-21173
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-21173
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Bug
>            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
>            Assignee: Andy Huang
>            Priority: Minor
>             Fix For: 4.4.0
>
>
> Multiple staging repositories being created is a known issue in Nexus 2 when publishing in parallel. "Get a slower laptop" is not a great workaround for the RM.



