Subject: [ANNOUNCE] New committer: Sushant Mahajan
To: dev@kafka.apache.org
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"
From: Andrew Schofield <schofielaj@apache.org>
Reply-To: <dev@kafka.apache.org>

The Project Management Committee (PMC) for Apache Kafka is pleased to
announce Sushant Mahajan as a new Kafka committer.

Sushant has made several significant contributions to the project.
He built upon the work of the coordinator framework to introduce the
share coordinator responsible for managing the state of share groups.
He created the batching and pruning mechanisms central to the share
coordinator's operation, balancing performance and resource usage while
ensuring data integrity. More recently, he added dead-letter queue support
for share groups.

He shows great attention to detail and persistence in his contributions,
and is a pleasure to work with.

Please join me in welcoming and congratulating Sushant!

Andrew Schofield
On behalf of the Apache Kafka PMC

