> > The Project Management Committee (PMC) for Apache Kafka is pleased to
> > announce Sushant Mahajan as a new Kafka committer.
> >
> > Sushant has made several significant contributions to the project.
> > He built upon the work of the coordinator framework to introduce the
> > share coordinator responsible for managing the state of share groups.
> > He created the batching and pruning mechanisms central to the share
> > coordinator's operation, balancing performance and resource usage while
> > ensuring data integrity. More recently, he added dead-letter queue
> support
> > for share groups.
> >
