Hello Kafka users, developers and client-developers,

This is the first candidate for release of Apache Kafka 4.3.2.

This is a bugfix release in 4.3 line.

Release notes for the 4.3.2 release:
=
https://dist.apache.org/repos/dist/dev/kafka/4.3.2-rc0/RELEASE_NOTES.html

Please download, test and vote by Friday, October 2nd, 9am PT

Kafka's KEYS file containing PGP keys we use to sign the release:
https://downloads.apache.org/kafka/KEYS

* Release artifacts to be voted upon (source and binary):
https://dist.apache.org/repos/dist/dev/kafka/4.3.2-rc0/

* Docker release artifacts to be voted upon:
apache/kafka:4.3.2-rc0 =
<https://hub.docker.com/layers/apache/kafka/4.3.2-rc0/images/sha256-aad4e6=
10fcbbb44b142dfe89c5d1e62262d0323bba68b46092853d3ee961c719>
apache/kafka-native:4.3.2-rc0 =
<https://hub.docker.com/layers/apache/kafka-native/4.3.2-rc0/images/sha256=
-aad4e610fcbbb44b142dfe89c5d1e62262d0323bba68b46092853d3ee961c719>

* Maven artifacts to be voted upon:
https://repository.apache.org/content/groups/staging/org/apache/kafka/

* Javadoc:
=
https://dist.apache.org/repos/dist/dev/kafka/4.3.2-rc0/javadoc/index.html

* Tag to be voted upon (off 4.3 branch) is the 4.3.2 tag:
https://github.com/apache/kafka/releases/tag/4.3.2-rc0

* Documentation:
https://kafka.apache.org/43/documentation.html

* Protocol:
https://kafka.apache.org/43/design/protocol

* Successful CI builds for the 4.3 branch:
Unit/integration tests: =
https://github.com/apache/kafka/actions/runs/36498239102
System tests: [will provide it soon]

* Successful Docker Image Github Actions Pipeline for 4.3 branch:
Docker Build Test Pipeline (JVM): =
https://github.com/apache/kafka/actions/runs/36444796001
Docker Build Test Pipeline (Native): =
https://github.com/apache/kafka/actions/runs/36444991180

Thanks,
Jiunn-Yang Huang=

