Subject: Bug Report - ProducerBatch.split() Straddling Signed Int Max
Message-Id: <D197841C-8E2B-41D3-9398-0CAB2A562D27@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 22:52:06 -0500
To: dev@kafka.apache.org
