Content-Transfer-Encoding: 7bit
X-JIRA-FingerPrint: 30527f35849b9dde25b450d4833f0394
From: "Chia-Ping Tsai (Jira)" <jira@apache.org>
Reply-To: <dev@kafka.apache.org>

Chia-Ping Tsai created KAFKA-21184:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: Fix the race condition in share session
                 Key: KAFKA-21184
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-21184
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
            Assignee: Apoorv Mittal


{{maybeRemoveAndNotifyListenersOnMemberLeave}} reads the session under the lock, but {{onMemberLeave}} runs outside it. If another thread replaces the session in between, {{onMemberLeave}} -> {{releaseSession}} -> {{cache.remove(key)}} still removes by key, so it removes the new session instead of the old one.



--
