Hello Kafka users, developers and client-developers,

This is the latest candidate for release of Apache Kafka 4.4.0.

Apache Kafka 4.4.0 is a minor release that includes 26 KIPs spanning =
improvements to all components.

Release notes for the 4.4.0 release:
=
https://dist.apache.org/repos/dist/dev/kafka/4.4.0-rc3/RELEASE_NOTES.html

Please download, test and vote by Monday, October 5, 2026 9:00am PT =
(5:00pm BST)

Kafka's KEYS file containing PGP keys we use to sign the release:
https://downloads.apache.org/kafka/KEYS

Release artifacts to be voted upon (source and binary):
