Hello! I have 2 small MM2 feature requests / documentation I think could be=
 helpful. I was unsure how to share so sending an email.


  1.  In our Kafka cluster we unfortunately need to have the auto-topic cre=
ation turned off. For MM2 this can make running it for the first time prett=
y painful since you need to figure out what internal topics need to be crea=
ted and manually create them. For users that have auto-topic creation turne=
d off it would be very helpful either if it was well documented how to crea=
te the internal topics or if you provided a script for generating the topic=
s.
  2.  In Java there is the RemoteClusterUtils for translating consumer grou=
p offsets between Kafka clusters. Can Kafka add client support for other la=
nguages such as Python?

Happy to also open up a CR for these, but was unsure if other users wanted =
them.

Thanks, Jeremy Bohrer

